      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUE NORTH (1) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (25.49) at this track over 450m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Capable of going well again. NEVER BEEN HERE (5) is an Andrew Paraskevas-trained newcomer by Aussie Infrared out of Quena Dee Air. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Market moves likely to signal ability but profiles strongly for this. EXACTITUDE (6) has his first outing without a trial but profiles nicely for this. Among the main hopes. SHADOW BOXER (8) placed on debut and is in the mix again.",
